> The first time I tried to cross the river east of the watchtower, I
> evaded the direct line to the guard in the tower until I stood on the
> first ice cell. The guard shoots with his wand, the ice melts, I drop
> into the water and crawl to the ice east of my former position, the
> ice there melts from the *same* fire ray and after dropping into the
> river I have crossed the river.

BTW, is this considered a bug?

If I setup are room in the following way

---------
|..````.| D: red dragon
|D..@I..| @: player standing on ice
|..````.| I: ice
---------

then I get these messages:

The red dragon breathes fire!
The ice crackles and melts.
You fall into the water!
You sink like a rock.
You try to crawl out of the water.  Pheew!  That was close.
The ice crackles and melts.
You fall into the water!
You sink like a rock.
You try to crawl out of the water.  Pheew!  That was close.
The blast of fire hits you!
[...]

So the blast of fire does wait *twice* for me to crawl out of the
water before hitting me on the third try?

